# What Tilt does not watch, and so does not sync into the agent's pod.
#
# The agent's image is a custom_build, which - unlike docker_build - does not read
# .dockerignore, and its live_update syncs all of src/. A `dotnet build` or ./scripts/test.sh
# on this machine writes src/*/bin and src/*/obj, and without this file those went into the pod
# beside the ones `dotnet watch` builds there: a macOS apphost over the Linux one, and the pod's
# next start was "Exec format error". Under src/ only - coder/bin holds source.
src/**/bin/
src/**/obj/
